ramic powders. It also provides industrial ceramics for applications in mining and mineral processing, power and energy systems, mobility, semiconductors and electronics, and aerospace and defense; and dense refractories, including bricks and engineered shapes, insulating, and range of monolithic refractories, pre-cast pre-fired components, acid-resistant liners comprising carbon bricks, advanced composites, specialty screeding and coatings, polymer concrete cells, and structural composites, including piping for abrasion resistance; and graphene, phase change materials, high-purity silicon carbide, and specialty polymers. In addition, the company offers IT infrastructure facility management, software application development, remote infrastructure management, and IT security management services; and operates gas-based power generation facility. Carborundum Universal Limited was incorporated in 1954 and is based in Chennai, India.","beta":0.466,"sharesOutstanding":190510134,"marketCap":202798039040,"trailingPE":137.0013,"forwardPE":35.6461,"priceToBook":5.0905,"enterpriseToEbitda":33.169,"dividendYield":0.38,"heldPercentInsiders":0.3937,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.3865,"earningsGrowth":-0.832,"revenueGrowth":0.132,"website":"https://www.cumi-murugappa.com","fullTimeEmployees":2340,"recommendationKey":"underperform","targetMeanPrice":1062.6666,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":6,"financialCurrency":"INR"},"estimates":{"eps":{"0q":{"avg":5.9,"low":5.9,"high":5.9,"yearAgoEps":4.01,"numberOfAnalysts":1.0,"growth":0.4713,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1q":{"avg":6.8,"low":6.8,"high":6.8,"yearAgoEps":8.6195,"numberOfAnalysts":1.0,"growth":-0.2111,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"0y":{"avg":23.2632,"low":22.2,"high":25.4,"yearAgoEps":14.5401,"numberOfAnalysts":5.0,"growth":0.5999,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1y":{"avg":29.863,"low":27.4,"high":32.5,"yearAgoEps":23.2632,"numberOfAnalysts":6.0,"growth":0.2837,"currency":"INR","methodology